OL,3,GNEWSAVillage votes to leave UK over
OL,4,Aasylum housing plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe referendum was organised by the
OL,7,Flocal parish council and out of 312
OL,8,Fvotes cast, 285 voted to leave, there
OL,9,Fwere 26 no votes, and one ballot paper
OL,10,Fwas spoiled.
